<p>aperfmperf_snapshot_cpu函数用于x86架构下的CPU频率监控机制，具体通过Intel CPU的MSR_IA32_APERF（实际性能计数器）和 MSR_IA32_MPERF（最大性能计数器）寄存器来计算CPU的当前平均频率。该函数的目的是高效地捕捉性能计数器的快照，避免不必要的计算开销（如在短时间内重复读取 MSR），并确保数据新鲜度。函数并不直接读取MSR，而是通过ipi在目标CPU上执行实际的快照操作。</p>



<p>这个线程阻塞在通过smp_call_function_single向某个指定cpu发送ipi让其执行回调函数aperfmperf_snapshot_khz来捕捉性能计数器快照：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>crash&gt; dis -s aperfmperf_snapshot_cpu+0x40
FILE: arch/x86/kernel/cpu/aperfmperf.c
LINE: 77

  72                    return true;
  73
  74            smp_call_function_single(cpu, aperfmperf_snapshot_khz, NULL, wait);  &lt;&lt;&lt;---
  75
  76            /* Return false if the previous iteration was too long ago. */
* 77            return time_delta &lt;= APERFMPERF_STALE_THRESHOLD_MS;
  78    }</pre>
</div></div>

<p>查看smp_call_function_single反汇编， smp_call_function_single+0x88/0x8c/0x8e位置临近，call trace相同，可以归纳为同一种情况：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/./include/linux/compiler.h: 188
0xffffffff9734bbc8 &lt;smp_call_function_single+136&gt;:      mov    0x18(%r8),%eax   &lt;&lt;&lt;--- +0x88
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 108
0xffffffff9734bbcc &lt;smp_call_function_single+140&gt;:      test   $0x1,%al   &lt;&lt;&lt;--- +0x8c
0xffffffff9734bbce &lt;smp_call_function_single+142&gt;:      jne    0xffffffff9734bbc6 &lt;smp_call_function_single+134&gt;   &lt;&lt;&lt;--- +0x8e</pre>
</div></div>

<p>smp_call_function_single函数签名：</p>

<div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="codeContent panelContent">
<pre class="code-c"><span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">int</span></span> smp_call_function_single(<span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">int</span></span> cpu, smp_call_func_t func, <span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">void</span></span> *info, <span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">int</span></span> wait)</pre>
</div></div>

<p>源码片段：</p>

<div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="codeContent panelContent">
<pre class="code-c">268 <span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">int</span></span> smp_call_function_single(<span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">int</span></span> cpu, smp_call_func_t func, <span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">void</span></span> *info,
269                         ¦    <span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">int</span></span> wait)
270 {
......
292
293         csd = &amp;csd_stack;
294         if (!wait) {   &lt;&lt;&lt;--- 对于非同步ipi，在generic_exec_single前要先锁住csd
295                 csd = this_cpu_ptr(&amp;csd_data);
296                 csd_lock(csd);
297         }
298
299         err = generic_exec_single(cpu, csd, func, info);
300
301         if (wait)
302                 csd_lock_wait(csd);
303
304         put_cpu();
......</pre>
</div></div>

<div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="codeContent panelContent">
<pre class="code-c">106 <span class="code-keyword">static</span> __always_inline <span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">void</span></span> csd_lock_wait(call_single_data_t *csd)
107 {
108         smp_cond_load_acquire(&amp;csd-&gt;flags, !(VAL &amp; CSD_FLAG_LOCK));  &lt;&lt;&lt;--- 如果这里lock没有释放，说明有非同步ipi尚未完成
109 }
110
111 <span class="code-keyword">static</span> __always_inline <span class="code-keyword"><span class="code-object">void</span></span> csd_lock(call_single_data_t *csd)
112 {
113         csd_lock_wait(csd);
114         csd-&gt;flags |= CSD_FLAG_LOCK;
115
116         /*
117         ¦* prevent CPU from reordering the above assignment
118         ¦* to -&gt;flags with any subsequent assignments to other
119         ¦* fields of the specified call_single_data_t structure:
120         ¦*/
121         smp_wmb();
122 }</pre>
</div></div>

