0xffffffff9734bbcc &lt;smp_call_function_single+140&gt;:      test   $0x1,%al
0xffffffff9734bbce &lt;smp_call_function_single+142&gt;:      jne    0xffffffff9734bbc6 &lt;smp_call_function_single+134&gt;
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 114
0xffffffff9734bbd0 &lt;smp_call_function_single+144&gt;:      orl    $0x1,0x18(%r8)
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 299
0xffffffff9734bbd5 &lt;smp_call_function_single+149&gt;:      mov    %rdx,%rcx
0xffffffff9734bbd8 &lt;smp_call_function_single+152&gt;:      mov    %rsi,%rdx
0xffffffff9734bbdb &lt;smp_call_function_single+155&gt;:      mov    %r8,%rsi
0xffffffff9734bbde &lt;smp_call_function_single+158&gt;:      call   0xffffffff9734ba80 &lt;generic_exec_single&gt;</pre>
</div></div>

<p>并且smp_call_function_single中没有修改%rdi（cpu）、%rsi（func）。所以从堆栈可知，cpu为9，func为aperfmperf_snapshot_khz，wait为0。当前cpu#9上还有没完成的异步ipi请求。</p>

<p>查看*所有smp_call_function_single类型堆栈的目标cpu均为cpu#9，也就是说cpu#9一直没有完成之前的异步ipi请求*。</p>

