            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL247640https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL247640at06%2FJan%2F263%3A28AM%2Clasteditedby%E9%99%88%E5%A5%87https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fpeople%2F557058%3A1e1c47af84e443b88bc448b51d054387at06%2FJan%2F263%3A34AM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-47640" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-47640</a> at 06/Jan/26 3:28 AM, last edited by <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/people/557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">陈奇</a> at 06/Jan/26 3:34 AM</h5>

<h3><a name="RIP%3A0010%3Asmpcallfunctionmany"></a>RIP: 0010:smp_call_function_many</h3>

<p>以下面打栈为例分析：</p>

