<p>smp_call_function_many函数用于在多个CPU上同步调用一个函数，通常涉及ipi来通知其他cpu执行回调函数。</p>

<p>上上一个情况相似，rip也是位于csd_lock_wait的自旋等待循环中：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>0xffffffff9734c09a &lt;smp_call_function_many+490&gt;: pause  # f3 90 (rep nop)
0xffffffff9734c09c &lt;smp_call_function_many+492&gt;: mov 0x18(%rcx),%edx
0xffffffff9734c09f &lt;smp_call_function_many+495&gt;: and $0x1,%edx
0xffffffff9734c0a2 &lt;smp_call_function_many+498&gt;: jne 0xffffffff9734c09a</pre>
</div></div>

<p>在函数开始时，参数wait被放在%r13中，并始终没有被修改过：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 405
0xffffffff9734beb0 &lt;smp_call_function_many&gt;:    nopl   0x0(%rax,%rax,1) [FTRACE NOP]
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 407
0xffffffff9734beb5 &lt;smp_call_function_many+5&gt;:  push   %r15
0xffffffff9734beb7 &lt;smp_call_function_many+7&gt;:  mov    %ecx,%r15d
0xffffffff9734beba &lt;smp_call_function_many+10&gt;: push   %r14
0xffffffff9734bebc &lt;smp_call_function_many+12&gt;: mov    %rdi,%r14
0xffffffff9734bebf &lt;smp_call_function_many+15&gt;: push   %r13
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 405
0xffffffff9734bec1 &lt;smp_call_function_many+17&gt;: mov    %ecx,%r13d   &lt;&lt;&lt;--- </pre>
</div></div>

<p>从堆栈可知wait为1，也就是smp_call_function_many向所有指定cpu发送的都是同步的ipi请求，需要等所有指定cpu完成回调函数后才能结束。</p>

<p>rip的位置是在等待所有指定cpu完成的循环的csd_lock_wait中：</p>

<div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="codeContent panelContent">
<pre class="code-c">460         <span class="code-comment">/* Send a message to all CPUs in the map */</span>
461         arch_send_call_function_ipi_mask(cfd-&gt;cpumask_ipi);
462
463         if (wait) {
464                 for_each_cpu(cpu, cfd-&gt;cpumask) {
465                         call_single_data_t *csd;
466
467                         csd = per_cpu_ptr(cfd-&gt;csd, cpu);
468                         csd_lock_wait(csd);   &lt;&lt;&lt;--- 
469                 }
470         }</pre>
</div></div>

<p>指定cpu的遍历是通过for_each_cpu(cpu, cfd-&gt;cpumask) → cpumask_next实现：</p>

<div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="codeContent panelContent">
<pre class="code-c">460         <span class="code-comment">/* Send a message to all CPUs in the map */</span>
461         arch_send_call_function_ipi_mask(cfd-&gt;cpumask_ipi);
462
463         if (wait) {
464                 for_each_cpu(cpu, cfd-&gt;cpumask) {
465                         call_single_data_t *csd;
466
467                         csd = per_cpu_ptr(cfd-&gt;csd, cpu);
468                         csd_lock_wait(csd);
469                 }
470         }

......

233 <span class="code-macro">#define for_each_cpu(cpu, mask)                         \
</span>234         <span class="code-keyword">for</span> ((cpu) = -1;                                \
235                 (cpu) = cpumask_next((cpu), (mask)),    \
236                 (cpu) &lt; nr_cpu_ids;)</pre>
</div></div>

<p>对应反汇编，当前cpu会作为cpumask_next的返回值放在%rax里：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>crash&gt; call_function_data -xo
struct call_function_data {
   [0x0] call_single_data_t *csd;
   [0x8] cpumask_var_t cpumask;
  [0x10] cpumask_var_t cpumask_ipi;
}

/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 463
0xffffffff9734c05f &lt;smp_call_function_many+431&gt;:        test   %r15b,%r15b    &lt;&lt;&lt;--- wait is true
0xffffffff9734c062 &lt;smp_call_function_many+434&gt;:        je     0xffffffff9734bf1d &lt;smp_call_function_many+109&gt;
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 464
0xffffffff9734c068 &lt;smp_call_function_many+440&gt;:        mov    $0xffffffff,%eax
0xffffffff9734c06d &lt;smp_call_function_many+445&gt;:        mov    0x8(%rbx),%rsi
0xffffffff9734c071 &lt;smp_call_function_many+449&gt;:        mov    %eax,%edi
0xffffffff9734c073 &lt;smp_call_function_many+451&gt;:        call   0xffffffff97a40280 &lt;cpumask_next&gt;   &lt;&lt;&lt;--- 当前cpu放在%rax
0xffffffff9734c078 &lt;smp_call_function_many+456&gt;:        cmp    0x12b9696(%rip),%eax        # 0xffffffff98605714 &lt;nr_cpu_ids&gt;
0xffffffff9734c07e &lt;smp_call_function_many+462&gt;:        jae    0xffffffff9734bf1d &lt;smp_call_function_many+109&gt;
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 467
0xffffffff9734c084 &lt;smp_call_function_many+468&gt;:        movslq %eax,%rdx
0xffffffff9734c087 &lt;smp_call_function_many+471&gt;:        mov    (%rbx),%rcx
0xffffffff9734c08a &lt;smp_call_function_many+474&gt;:        add    -0x67cc97a0(,%rdx,8),%rcx
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/./include/linux/compiler.h: 188
0xffffffff9734c092 &lt;smp_call_function_many+482&gt;:        mov    0x18(%rcx),%edx
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 108
0xffffffff9734c095 &lt;smp_call_function_many+485&gt;:        and    $0x1,%edx
0xffffffff9734c098 &lt;smp_call_function_many+488&gt;:        je     0xffffffff9734c0a4 &lt;smp_call_function_many+500&gt;
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/./arch/x86/include/asm/processor.h: 677
0xffffffff9734c09a &lt;smp_call_function_many+490&gt;:        pause
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/./include/linux/compiler.h: 188
0xffffffff9734c09c &lt;smp_call_function_many+492&gt;:        mov    0x18(%rcx),%edx   &lt;&lt;&lt;--- call_single_data_t-&gt;flags (0x18)
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 108
0xffffffff9734c09f &lt;smp_call_function_many+495&gt;:        and    $0x1,%edx
0xffffffff9734c0a2 &lt;smp_call_function_many+498&gt;:        jne    0xffffffff9734c09a &lt;smp_call_function_many+490&gt;
0xffffffff9734c0a4 &lt;smp_call_function_many+500&gt;:        jmp    0xffffffff9734c06d &lt;smp_call_function_many+445&gt;
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 421
0xffffffff9734c0a6 &lt;smp_call_function_many+502&gt;:        mov    $0xffffffff98604ce0,%rdx
0xffffffff9734c0ad &lt;smp_call_function_many+509&gt;:        mov    %r14,%rsi
0xffffffff9734c0b0 &lt;smp_call_function_many+512&gt;:        mov    %ebx,%edi
0xffffffff9734c0b2 &lt;smp_call_function_many+514&gt;:        call   0xffffffff97a40350 &lt;cpumask_next_and&gt;
0xffffffff9734c0b7 &lt;smp_call_function_many+519&gt;:        mov    %eax,%r8d
0xffffffff9734c0ba &lt;smp_call_function_many+522&gt;:        jmp    0xffffffff9734bf14 &lt;smp_call_function_many+100&gt;
/usr/src/debug/kernel-4.18.0-147.5.1.el8_1/linux-4.18.0-147.5.1.es8_24.x86_64/kernel/smp.c: 434</pre>
</div></div>

<p>从堆栈可知，当前cpu为000000000000000e，也就是cpu#14。</p>



<p>所有的smp_call_function_many属于同一种情况：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>0010:smp_call_function_many+0x1ea/0x250
0010:smp_call_function_many+0x1ec/0x250
0010:smp_call_function_many+0x1ef/0x250
0010:smp_call_function_many+0x1f2/0x250</pre>
</div></div>

<p>归纳*所有此类堆栈的当前cpu，为cpu#8、11、14、73，也就是说这4个cpu长时间没有完成ipi请求*：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>#: cat /Users/dakeiskind/Downloads/ECSL2-47640/ecs.20260104140429.latest/ecs.node-76.20260104140429.latest/os/messages.node-76.20260104.log | grep "kernel: RIP: 0010:smp_call_function_many+" -A3 | grep " RAX:" | awk '{print $16}' | sort | uniq
0000000000000008
000000000000000b
000000000000000e
0000000000000049</pre>
</div></div>

<p><b>目前看到的这5个无法完成ipi请求的cpu没有任何打栈，也就是说不清楚这些cpu当前的状态，也无法确认为什么长时间没有完成ipi请求。</b></p>
        </td></tr>
