<p>这3种堆栈都是进程正在等待pmd自旋锁。这个锁来自于pmd_lock.isra.21函数，用于获取pmd级的页表锁，这类锁用于保护页表中间目录的访问和修改。</p>

<p>pmd_lock源码：</p>

<div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="codeContent panelContent">
<pre class="code-c">2046 <span class="code-keyword">static</span> <span class="code-keyword">inline</span> spinlock_t *pmd_lock(<span class="code-keyword">struct</span> mm_struct *mm, pmd_t *pmd)
2047 {
2048         spinlock_t *ptl = pmd_lockptr(mm, pmd);
2049         spin_lock(ptl);   &lt;&lt;&lt;--- 
2050         <span class="code-keyword">return</span> ptl;
2051 }</pre>
</div></div>

<p>_raw_spin_lock反汇编：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
